            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The largest open world RPG ever made in RPG Maker. If you're looking for something unique, epic, and with countless builds, you've found it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classless party members that can learn or equip anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 weapon types and 25 elements with over a thousand skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive talent tree to improve your town and team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat psychology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game+.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No max level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, you unironically saying murda for the rest of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released in the summer of 2016, Wooden Ocean has received consistent updates for the last 10 years, more than tripling its original size and story. These updates will continue long after it's tripled again.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The largest open world RPG ever made in RPG Maker. If you're looking for something unique, epic, and with countless builds, you've found it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classless party members that can learn or equip anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 weapon types and 25 elements with over a thousand skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive talent tree to improve your town and team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat psychology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game+.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No max level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, you unironically saying murda for the rest of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released in the summer of 2016, Wooden Ocean has received consistent updates for the last 10 years, more than tripling its original size and story. These updates will continue long after it's tripled again.</p>",
